WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.450
Wow!

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.950
Look at that craftsmanship.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.350
Cool!

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.750
- It's amazing!
- I want it.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:14.720
I've watched Gundam and built Gunpla
since I was in kindergarten.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:18.060
I've even been showcased in
model-building magazines.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:23.000
I never thought there'd be anyone
better than me at Gunpla building.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:32.510
I had become swellheaded.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:35.540
Thinking about it now,
how childish I was.

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:37.980
Though I still am a child.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:40.150
But...

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.800
There's always someone better.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.370
There's no end to Gunpla.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.840
That's what that man...

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.840
That's what my master taught me.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:41.420
The day has finally come.

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:46.360
The 7th Gunpla Battle
Championship World Tournament.

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:50.930
The tournament finals start today,

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:54.330
with the 16 teams that
made it through the qualifiers.

00:02:55.270 --> 00:03:00.170
The battles will probably get
very fierce from here on.

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:06.280
I wonder how the fighters
must be feeling this morning.

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:11.650
Like Iori and Reiji...

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.320
Wake up, both of you!

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:17.690
M-Mom...

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:21.230
What? Let me sleep.

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:23.390
I just finished the Build Strike's—

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.030
Just wake up!

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:28.370
Brackets for the tournament finals
will be announced today!

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.700
You'll be late if you don't wake up!

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.570
You're already late!

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:34.710
What!?

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:43.250
When humans become Newtypes,
one day they'll even be able to control time.

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:47.750
- Sei, stop babbling and hurry!
- ﻿Why do we repeat the same mistakes?

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.660
Looks like we made it.

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:01.600
Our first opponent is...

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.000
It's me.

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:06.400
The one who you guys will be fighting against.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:10.840
It's me, Mao Yasaka.

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:13.040
Mao...

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:16.010
I see. The time has come at last.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.280
Yes, it finally has.

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:21.020
We'll have our showdown.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.030
There will be two battles today.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:40.800
Obviously Meijin Kawaguchi
and Aila Jyrkiainen will win.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.670
Hey, Samurai Boy.

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:47.410
Looks like both our
first battles are gonna be easy.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:50.580
You should never be off guard,
Mr. Fellini.

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:55.650
Although, there's no factor
that could make me lose.

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:58.320
You're a smart-mouthed kid.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:02.090
Even if you win the first battle,
the next one will be tough.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:04.500
In my second battle I'll face...

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:09.170
The winner of Mao Yasaka
versus Sei Iori and Reiji?

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.340
Hey, let's hear the genius's opinion.

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:16.770
Which do you think will win?

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.180
Let's see.
According to my prediction...

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.020
Attack with the regular rifle.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:30.250
Particle beam is absorbed
by the shield.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.160
It discharges the absorbed particles...

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:34.830
and then accelerates!

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:42.030
No!

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:49.440
Then I'll lead off with the hyper
satellite cannon that it can't absorb.

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:57.980
But Mr. Reiji would dodge it.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:01.820
That won't work either.

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:05.120
The Build Strike is approaching.
Fire back with vulcans.

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:07.730
It's coming even closer.
Respond with beam saber.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:11.460
Saber to saber.
Fire the satellite when separating.

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:13.000
No, he'd dodge that.

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:17.200
Put away the regular rifle,
attach a missile pod...

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:18.840
Not enough ammo.

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:24.010
Even in close combat,
I'm overpowered.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:33.550
The Build Strike has that glowing system...

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:38.090
I can't imagine any winning moves!

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.870
Old man!

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.040
Teach me how to do that awesome trick!

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:54.040
Awesome trick?

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:55.370
You just did it.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:59.510
Blowing away your opponent's
Gunpla like boom! Teach me!

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:01.450
No, I can't be bothered.

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:03.850
Come on, teach me!

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:06.820
I want to do that trick!
I want to get stronger!

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.520
And become the best
Gunpla builder in the world!

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:11.720
I'm not leaving until you do!

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:13.420
Want some soba noodles?

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.530
Yes please.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:20.300
You've got to teach me today!

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:23.000
I can't. I have to train now.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.370
Train?

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:26.640
At what? Let me join you!

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:32.140
Is fishing a training?

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:33.210
Yeah.

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.210
Will this make you
stronger in battles?

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:38.120
Of course!

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:43.050
Look.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:45.020
Me, too!

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:48.630
That was good!

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:18.260
The two battles that took place
today were very interesting.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:22.360
Tomorrow it's your turn.
I wish you luck.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:24.460
Leave it to us.

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:26.360
- Right?
- Yeah!

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.170
Isn't that Mao?

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.330
Huh?

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:33.000
Yeah.

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:50.520
W-Wow!

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:54.290
You really are awesome, Master!

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.560
Please teach me that trick!

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:00.630
Oh, that's not a big deal.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:05.670
If you follow the Gunpla Shingyo school
until you're about my age,

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.800
you'll be able to do things like that.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:11.410
Don't be mean, just teach me already!

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:14.680
Mao, this isn't something
you can be taught.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:18.320
Even if I could teach you,
would that make you happy?

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:22.720
Would it satisfy you to imitate
the exact same Gunpla...

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:24.290
as somebody else built?

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:29.190
That's not the Gunpla I'm seeking.

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:33.330
That's not the way of the Shingyo school.

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:38.640
Gunpla is about
imagination and originality.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.410
You have to find that yourself.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.340
There's no right answer.

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:49.180
You must use your experiences
to expand your imagination,

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:52.720
and then model the ideal
that lies within your heart.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.950
That is the Gunpla Shingyo school.

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:12.370
How long are you staying there?

00:10:16.270 --> 00:10:19.880
Aren't you in the middle
of a tournament?

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:23.910
Master!

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:25.820
Please... Please...!

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:30.950
Please teach me your trick!

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:35.760
Please teach me your trick!

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:37.760
You said I'd have to find it myself.

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:41.100
I understand it's against
the teachings of our school.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:44.200
But I...!

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:47.200
I want to win tomorrow's battle!

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.070
Master, please!

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:52.940
Please teach me the innermost mystery
of the Gunpla Shingyo school!

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:00.780
Okay, just a little.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.820
M-Master, this is...

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:08.830
I'll teach you the mystery
of the Shingyo school.

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:11.730
But I won't teach your head,

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:13.100
I'll teach your body!

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:14.000
Bring it on!

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:23.170
Stand up! We don't have time!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.690
What're you lying down for!? Get up!

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.630
How is this going to help?

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:48.230
I'm just being thrown around.

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:49.970
It's only hurting my body.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:53.270
That's it? How pitiful!

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:56.370
Master, I...

00:11:56.640 --> 00:12:00.710
Didn't you beg on the ground for this?
Out of gas, already?

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:02.850
Is this all the resolve you've got!?

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:05.650
Bring it!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:15.990
Hey, Master.

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:18.100
What, Mao?

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:22.170
Who's your favorite female character
in all the Gundam series?

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.540
Mine's definitely Miss Emma Sheen.

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:29.870
I think she's pretty
and she's really determined.

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:31.440
And you?

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:33.810
Me?

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.150
I...

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.510
Fire! Fire!

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.350
Murrue Ramius is my only choice.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:44.050
You're dirty-minded!

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:47.720
You don't need reasons
to like something.

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:49.530
You simply like it.

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:52.300
Right, Mao?

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.940
M-Master?

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:09.880
A letter?

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.890
<i>﻿I'm tired so I'm going home.</i>

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:18.120
What the heck!?

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:21.660
He's so selfish,
doing whatever he likes!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.260
Whatever you like...

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:37.640
I see...

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:39.410
You're right.

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:44.250
But, Master...

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:47.750
I still think Miss Emma is the best.

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:52.860
Because I simply like her.

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:03.970
That lady...

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.640
Where's the entrance?

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:07.470
Hey.

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:09.970
Oh, you!

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:11.840
You stayed at our inn before.

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:14.810
I knew it. You're from that inn.

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:16.580
Yes, I'm Misaki.

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:20.350
Did you come to cheer for Mao Yasaka?

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:21.990
Yes.

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:24.520
I feel bad for Iori and Reiji.

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:31.860
<i>﻿We now begin match three in the
first round of the tournament finals.</i>

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.400
Where's Mao?

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.770
We don't wanna win by default, do we?

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:43.670
Don't worry.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:48.350
We promised to battle
in the World Tournament.

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:50.950
He'll definitely come.

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:03.190
Sorry I'm late.

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:11.970
<i>﻿Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:18.840
<i>﻿Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:26.150
<i>﻿Field 1, Space.</i>

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.550
- Sei Iori!
- ﻿Reiji.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.020
Mao Yasaka!

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:37.890
- Star Build Strike Gundam!
- Gundam X Maoh!

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:39.260
Let's go!

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:40.230
Here I go!

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:50.940
Already!?

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:02.650
How can he keep firing!?

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:17.600
That's a solar panel!?

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:18.540
I get it!

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:23.710
It's using a Solar System for power
to gather the surrounding particles!

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:26.480
Its reflectors have been enhanced, too.

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:28.680
<i>﻿Sei, the explanation doesn't matter.</i>

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:32.320
Can't you tell from his Gunpla's moves?

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:36.750
He's enjoying this battle!

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.320
Here I go!

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:51.030
Well then, we're going all out, too!

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.760
Being able to enjoy
a battle in this situation,

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:20.930
Mao, you're really awesome.

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:26.140
This battle's great!

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:29.840
Not bad, Mao.

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:32.380
Not bad.

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:33.780
Mao's doing well.

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:36.950
He must've practiced hard yesterday.

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:40.780
He was blinded by seeing
victory in front of him.

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:42.850
I just cleared up his doubts.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:45.660
He's now absorbed in fighting...

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.990
With an unclouded heart.

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:53.830
The Shingyo school models one's heart
in the tangible form of Gunpla.

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:55.470
As well as in battles.

00:17:57.000 --> 00:18:01.810
You've grasped the innermost mystery
of the Shingyo school, Mao!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.160
A-Awesome...

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:29.770
This one's really going to hurt!

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:33.200
- So is this!
- ﻿Yeah!

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:35.810
Activating Solar System!

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:41.080
And...

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.000
This is my...!

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.100
Maoh Sword!

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:08.370
Activating RG System!

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:19.020
Go, Build Knuckle!

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:30.450
Mao.

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:32.360
Misaki.

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:35.390
You came?

00:20:35.390 --> 00:20:37.490
Thanks for coming all this way.

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:40.230
I'm flattered...

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:47.370
You were really awesome!

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:16.730
Master...

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:19.470
That was an interesting battle.

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:22.840
This is why I can't quit Gunpla.

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:25.910
Master.

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:33.320
I want to build much better Gunpla.

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:36.550
No, I'm going to build it!

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:38.720
Just watch!

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:18.120
Mao sure was strong.

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:19.690
Yeah.

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:23.330
I bet the next time we battle him,
he'll even be stronger.

00:23:24.260 --> 00:23:26.100
That's just what
we're hoping for, right?

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:27.500
Yeah.

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:32.840
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:23:34.570 --> 00:23:35.740
- What!?
- ﻿What's that!?

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:40.840
N-No way...

00:23:42.210 --> 00:23:44.750
Mr. Luang lost...?

00:23:45.850 --> 00:23:46.550
To whom?

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:52.050
So much for being a top contender.

00:23:52.060 --> 00:23:54.960
That was a piece of cake.

00:23:56.200 --> 00:24:00.140
The Renato brothers attack Meijin
Kawaguchi with their shrewd tactics.

00:24:00.140 --> 00:24:01.980
Next episode, "Bloodhounds".

00:24:01.980 --> 00:24:05.060
Their tactics shake our core!
